OL,3,GNEWSALife after Eurovision for Look Mum
OL,4,ANo Computer
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was speaking ahead of his
OL,7,Fperformance on Sunday at the Ramsgate
OL,8,FFestival of Sound at the Granville
OL,9,FTheatre where he plans to include Eins,
OL,10,FZwei, Drei in his set.
